{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 11,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 471.965,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it came to pass after I had desired to know the things that my father had seen,",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.103,
      "end": 8.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and believing that the Lord was able to make them known unto me,",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.812,
      "end": 11.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as I sat pondering in mine heart",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.5,
      "end": 14.519,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I was caught away in the Spirit of the Lord,",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.699,
      "end": 17.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, into an exceedingly high mountain,",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.712,
      "end": 19.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I never had before seen,",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 19.935,
      "end": 22.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon which I never had before set my foot.",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 23.634,
      "end": 25.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Spirit said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 25.811,
      "end": 27.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, what desirest thou?",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 28.163,
      "end": 29.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said:",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 29.597,
      "end": 32.569,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I desire to behold the things which my father saw.",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 33.249,
      "end": 35.246,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Spirit said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 35.426,
      "end": 40.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou that thy father saw the tree of which he hath spoken?",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 40.704,
      "end": 41.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said:",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 42.138,
      "end": 45.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, thou knowest that I believe all the words of my father.",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 46.533,
      "end": 48.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when I had spoken these words,",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 48.849,
      "end": 51.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Spirit cried with a loud voice, saying:",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 51.258,
      "end": 52.744,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Hosanna to the Lord,",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 52.924,
      "end": 54.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the most high God;",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 54.683,
      "end": 58.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he is God over all the earth, yea, even above all.",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 58.392,
      "end": 60.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed art thou, Nephi,",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 60.708,
      "end": 64.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because thou believest in the Son of the most high God;",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 64.232,
      "end": 68.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, thou shalt behold the things which thou hast desired.",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 68.906,
      "end": 72.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold this thing shall be given unto thee for a sign,",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 72.894,
      "end": 77.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that after thou hast beheld the tree which bore the fruit which thy father tasted,",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 77.579,
      "end": 81.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou shalt also behold a man descending out of heaven",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 81.242,
      "end": 83.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and him shall ye witness;",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 83.28,
      "end": 85.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after ye have witnessed him",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 85.503,
      "end": 88.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall bear record that it is the Son of God.",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 89.294,
      "end": 92.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Spirit said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 92.539,
      "end": 93.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look!",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 93.508,
      "end": 95.784,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked and beheld a tree;",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 95.964,
      "end": 99.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was like unto the tree which my father had seen;",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 99.72,
      "end": 102.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the beauty thereof was far beyond,",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 102.315,
      "end": 104.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, exceeding of all beauty;",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 104.492,
      "end": 108.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the whiteness thereof did exceed the whiteness of the driven snow.",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 109.584,
      "end": 112.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass after I had seen the tree,",
      "verse": "11:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 112.55,
      "end": 114.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I said unto the Spirit:",
      "verse": "11:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 114.402,
      "end": 118.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I behold thou hast shown unto me the tree which is precious above all.",
      "verse": "11:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 119.262,
      "end": 120.702,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 120.882,
      "end": 122.229,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What desirest thou?",
      "verse": "11:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 122.909,
      "end": 124.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto him:",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 124.714,
      "end": 126.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "To know the interpretation thereof\u2014",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 127.077,
      "end": 129.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I spake unto him as a man speaketh;",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 129.904,
      "end": 133.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I beheld that he was in the form of a man;",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 133.195,
      "end": 136.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet nevertheless, I knew that it was the Spirit of the Lord;",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 137.09,
      "end": 140.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he spake unto me as a man speaketh with another.",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 141.253,
      "end": 143.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 143.848,
      "end": 144.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look!",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 144.817,
      "end": 148.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked as if to look upon him, and I saw him not;",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 148.201,
      "end": 150.709,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he had gone from before my presence.",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 151.389,
      "end": 153.665,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I looked",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 153.845,
      "end": 156.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and beheld the great city of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 156.579,
      "end": 158.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also other cities.",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 158.431,
      "end": 160.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I beheld the city of Nazareth;",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 161.026,
      "end": 164.509,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the city of Nazareth I beheld a virgin,",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 164.689,
      "end": 167.104,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and she was exceedingly fair and white.",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 167.784,
      "end": 170.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I saw the heavens open;",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 170.983,
      "end": 173.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and an angel came down and stood before me;",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 173.439,
      "end": 174.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 175.152,
      "end": 177.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nephi, what beholdest thou?",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 177.782,
      "end": 179.407,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto him:",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 179.587,
      "end": 180.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "A virgin,",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 180.928,
      "end": 184.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "most beautiful and fair above all other virgins.",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 185.091,
      "end": 186.531,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 186.711,
      "end": 189.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Knowest thou the condescension of God?",
      "verse": "11:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 189.713,
      "end": 191.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I said unto him:",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 191.518,
      "end": 193.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I know that he loveth his children;",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 193.881,
      "end": 196.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, I do not know the meaning of all things.",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 197.626,
      "end": 199.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:18",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 199.246,
      "end": 201.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, the virgin whom thou seest",
      "verse": "11:18",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 201.794,
      "end": 205.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is the mother of the Son of God, after the manner of the flesh.",
      "verse": "11:18",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 206.236,
      "end": 211.716,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld that she was carried away in the Spirit;",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 211.896,
      "end": 216.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after she had been carried away in the Spirit for the space of a time",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 216.395,
      "end": 218.531,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the angel spake unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 218.711,
      "end": 219.5,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look!",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 220.18,
      "end": 224.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked and beheld the virgin again, bearing a child in her arms.",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 225.643,
      "end": 227.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 227.356,
      "end": 229.028,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 229.208,
      "end": 231.716,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even the Son of the Eternal Father!",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 231.896,
      "end": 235.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Knowest thou the meaning of the tree which thy father saw?",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 235.734,
      "end": 237.824,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I answered him, saying:",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 238.004,
      "end": 239.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, it is the love of God,",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 239.995,
      "end": 243.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which sheddeth itself abroad in the hearts of the children of men;",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 243.937,
      "end": 247.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, it is the most desirable above all things.",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 248.1,
      "end": 250.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 250.184,
      "end": 252.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and the most joyous to the soul.",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 253.14,
      "end": 256.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after he had said these words, he said unto me:",
      "verse": "11:24",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 256.292,
      "end": 257.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look!",
      "verse": "11:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 257.261,
      "end": 262.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked, and I beheld the Son of God going forth among the children of men;",
      "verse": "11:24",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 262.828,
      "end": 266.357,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw many fall down at his feet and worship him.",
      "verse": "11:24",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 267.037,
      "end": 270.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I beheld that the rod of iron,",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 270.7,
      "end": 272.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which my father had seen,",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 272.598,
      "end": 274.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "was the word of God,",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 274.403,
      "end": 277.189,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which led to the fountain of living waters,",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 277.369,
      "end": 279.83,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to the tree of life; which waters",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 280.01,
      "end": 282.936,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are a representation of the love of God;",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 283.116,
      "end": 285.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I also beheld that the tree of life",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 285.618,
      "end": 288.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "was a representation of the love of God.",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 288.992,
      "end": 290.942,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel said unto me again:",
      "verse": "11:26",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 291.122,
      "end": 293.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look and behold the condescension of God!",
      "verse": "11:26",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 294.403,
      "end": 297.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked and beheld the Redeemer of the world,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 297.694,
      "end": 299.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of whom my father had spoken;",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 300.103,
      "end": 303.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I also beheld the prophet who should prepare the way before him.",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 303.812,
      "end": 305.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lamb of God went forth",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 306.175,
      "end": 307.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and was baptized of him;",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 308.12,
      "end": 309.838,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after he was baptized,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 310.018,
      "end": 311.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I beheld the heavens open,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 312.056,
      "end": 314.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Holy Ghost come down out of heaven",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 314.93,
      "end": 317.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and abide upon him in the form of a dove.",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 318.582,
      "end": 324.294,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I beheld that he went forth ministering unto the people, in power and great glory;",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 324.474,
      "end": 328.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the multitudes were gathered together to hear him;",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 328.323,
      "end": 332.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I beheld that they cast him out from among them.",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 332.858,
      "end": 335.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also beheld twelve others following him.",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 336.057,
      "end": 341.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they were carried away in the Spirit from before my face,",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 341.578,
      "end": 343.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw them not.",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 343.883,
      "end": 347.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the angel spake unto me again, saying:",
      "verse": "11:30",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 347.871,
      "end": 348.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look!",
      "verse": "11:30",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 348.84,
      "end": 352.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked, and I beheld the heavens open again,",
      "verse": "11:30",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 352.271,
      "end": 355.429,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw angels descending upon the children of men;",
      "verse": "11:30",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 355.609,
      "end": 357.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did minister unto them.",
      "verse": "11:30",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 358.286,
      "end": 360.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he spake unto me again, saying:",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 360.881,
      "end": 361.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look!",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 361.85,
      "end": 366.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked, and I beheld the Lamb of God going forth among the children of men.",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 367.046,
      "end": 370.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I beheld multitudes of people who were sick,",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 370.384,
      "end": 376.421,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who were afflicted with all manner of diseases, and with devils and unclean spirits;",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 376.601,
      "end": 379.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the angel spake and showed all these things unto me.",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 380.125,
      "end": 383.144,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were healed by the power of the Lamb of God;",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 383.324,
      "end": 386.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the devils and the unclean spirits were cast out.",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 387.348,
      "end": 391.156,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the angel spake unto me again, saying:",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 391.336,
      "end": 392.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look!",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 392.305,
      "end": 395.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I looked and beheld the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 395.225,
      "end": 397.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he was taken by the people;",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 397.681,
      "end": 401.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the Son of the everlasting God was judged of the world;",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 401.762,
      "end": 403.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I saw and bear record.",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 404.114,
      "end": 407.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Nephi, saw that he was lifted up upon the cross",
      "verse": "11:33",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 407.916,
      "end": 410.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and slain for the sins of the world.",
      "verse": "11:33",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 411.104,
      "end": 412.822,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after he was slain",
      "verse": "11:34",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 413.002,
      "end": 415.231,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I saw the multitudes of the earth,",
      "verse": "11:34",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 415.411,
      "end": 417.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they were gathered together",
      "verse": "11:34",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 417.774,
      "end": 420.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to fight against the apostles of the Lamb;",
      "verse": "11:34",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 420.462,
      "end": 423.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thus were the twelve called by the angel of the Lord.",
      "verse": "11:34",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 424.207,
      "end": 427.829,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the multitude of the earth was gathered together;",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 428.009,
      "end": 431.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I beheld that they were in a large and spacious building,",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 431.718,
      "end": 434.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "like unto the building which my father saw.",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 434.499,
      "end": 437.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel of the Lord spake unto me again, saying:",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 437.79,
      "end": 440.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold the world and the wisdom thereof;",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 440.385,
      "end": 443.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, behold the house of Israel hath gathered together",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 444.141,
      "end": 447.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to fight against the twelve apostles of the Lamb.",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 447.747,
      "end": 455.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I saw and bear record, that the great and spacious building was the pride of the world;",
      "verse": "11:36",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 455.404,
      "end": 456.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it fell,",
      "verse": "11:36",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 456.977,
      "end": 459.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the fall thereof was exceedingly great.",
      "verse": "11:36",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 459.525,
      "end": 462.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the angel of the Lord spake unto me again, saying:",
      "verse": "11:36",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 462.816,
      "end": 467.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus shall be the destruction of all nations, kindreds, tongues, and people,",
      "verse": "11:36",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 467.965,
      "end": 471.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that shall fight against the twelve apostles of the Lamb.",
      "verse": "11:36",
      "lineIndex": 159
    }
  ]
}